          "short": "$960$",
          "worked": "Treat (I, A) as a single unit. With three more consonants chosen from six, the five-letter word has four units.\n\nChoose one of four positions for the vowel unit, order three consonants from six, then arrange I and A within their unit.\n$$4\\times{}^{6}P_{3}\\times2=960$$",
